        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=Role: IT Support Classifier & Data Extractor.\nCategory List:\n{{ $('Get Category').all().map(item => `- ${item.json.Name}${item.json.Alias ? ' (Keywords: ' + item.json.Alias + ')' : ''}`).join(\"\\n\") }}\n\nTASK:\n1. Extract Branch: Name found in text, else null.\n2. Determine Category (CRITICAL LOGIC):\n   - If the text contains \"การแก้ไขปัญหา\" (Resolution), you MUST classify the category based on the ROOT CAUSE mentioned in the resolution. Completely ignore the initial symptoms. \n   - Example: Symptom is \"จอเรท\" (HW) but Resolution says \"Service\" or \"Software\" issue on server, you MUST classify as \"SW\".\n3. Identify Intent: \"INC\" (broken/error) or \"SR\" (request/setup/ดับไฟ).\n4. Generate Subject Summary: (THAI ONLY).\n\nSUMMARY FORMAT:\n\"[Branch] [Position/ID] [Device/Object] [Short Symptom or Root Cause]\"\n- Include identifiers like \"เคาน์เตอร์ 5\" or \"เครื่อง 2\" if present.\n- Tone: Professional, no polite particles (No ครับ/ค่ะ).\n- Technical terms (POS/LAN/WiFi/Printer/Server/Service) remain in English.\n- Max 60 characters.\n\nSPECIAL RULES:\n- สาขา 1 ผู้แจ้ง พนักงาน 1 และ พนักงาน 2 -> Category: IT.\n- \"PSS\" keyword -> Category: SW.\n- \"POS machine\" keyword -> Category: POS.\n- \"แก้ไข MC\" or \"เพิ่มลายเส้น MC\" -> Category: REQUEST, Intent: SR.\n- \"แจ้งดับไฟ\" -> Intent: SR."
            }
          ]
        },
